============

| Code / Term                                            | Purpose                                               |
| ------------------------------------------------------ | ----------------------------------------------------- |
| `from sagemaker import Predictor`                      | Imports the SageMaker `Predictor` class               |
| `Predictor(endpoint_name=...)`                         | Connects the Predictor object to an existing endpoint |
| `endpoint_name="insurance-charge-serverless-endpoint"` | Specifies which endpoint you want to delete           |
| `predictor.delete_endpoint()`                          | Deletes the endpoint                                  |
| `print(...)`                                           | Displays a success message                            |


