====

Important distinction

Your trained model file in S3, such as:

model.tar.gz

is not automatically deleted just because you deleted the endpoint. The endpoint is gone, but your model artifact may still remain in S3.

Simple meaning

predictor.delete_endpoint() = Stop and remove the live SageMaker model endpoint when you finish testing, helping avoid continued endpoint usage charges.

